<h2>What happens next</h2>
<p>We'll check your application and email you within 10 working days.</p>
<p>If we can give you the discount, we'll send you a new bill. It will show the discount from the date you became the only adult living in your home.</p>
<p>If we need more information, we'll contact you. You don't need to do anything else now.</p>

<h2>Tell us if things change</h2>
<p>You must tell us within 21 days if:</p>
<ul class="p-list">
  <li>another adult moves in with you</li>
  <li>someone living with you turns 18</li>
</ul>

